{
    "title": "Ultra Watch Face",
    "description": "\u2605 <b>Ultra Watch Face is fully Wear OS 3 supported</b>\r\n\r\nNEW! Completely new redesigned Ultra watch face!. A nice, clean and interactive real watch face with Premium upgrade option. \r\n\r\n\u2605<b>The watch face, currently, doesn't support Samsung Health</b>\u2605\r\n\r\n \u2605\u2605\u2605 Free version: \u2605\u2605\u2605 \r\n \u2714 Weather\r\n \u2714 Watch battery indicator\r\n \u2714 Phone battery indicator\r\n \u2714 24 hour format\r\n \u2714 Screen time\r\n\r\n \u2605\u2605\u2605 Premium version: \u2605\u2605\u2605\r\n \u2714 24 hour format\r\n \u2714 Leading zero\r\n \u2714 Screen time\r\n \u2714 Forecast\r\n \u2714 Full ambient mode option\r\n \u2714 Change a color preset on tap\r\n \u2714 Tap indicator\r\n \u2714  Google Fit integration\r\n \u2714 Background types\r\n \u2714 Vibrate on every hour\r\n \u2714 Weather settings (location, providers, frequency update, units)\r\n \u2714 Automatic or manual weather location\r\n \u2714 External and Built-in complications\r\n \u2714 No ads\r\n\r\n \u2605 Built-in complications (Premium) \u2605\r\n    \u2022 Steps\r\n    \u2022 Distance\r\n    \u2022 Walking\r\n    \u2022 Running\r\n    \u2022 Biking\r\n    \u2022 Calories\r\n    \u2022 Fit statistics\r\n    \u2022 Water counter\r\n    \u2022 Coffee counter\r\n    \u2022 HeartRate detector\r\n    \u2022 Steps counter from sensors in wear device (built-in steps)\r\n    \u2022 App shortcuts (Timer, Alarm, Flashlight, Stopwatch, Google Map, Find My Phone, Google Keep, Google Translate)\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605\u2605DISCLAIMER: \u2605\u2605\u2605 \r\n The watch face is standalone app but the complication for phone battery requires a connection with the companion app on Android phone devices. iPhone users can not have this data due to iOS limitation.\r\nThe free version doesn't have option to set complications. It shows only the current weather, phone and watch battery levels.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b> How to select shortcuts in the position (complication) (Premium) </b> \u2605\r\n\r\n- Long tap on the watch face\r\n- System shows icon \"gear\" for the watch face settings. Tap on it\r\n- Select \"Customize\" option\r\n- Select \"Complications\" option\r\n- Select desired position\r\n- Select \"External Complication\"\r\n- Find \"General\" from list and select one from the list \r\n- Select \"App shortcut\" and choose desired app\r\nYou are ready to go.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>Wear OS 3 integration</b>\r\n  \u2022\u2003Fully standalone! (iPhone and Android compatible)\r\n  \u2022\u2003External complication data for the indicators\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b>\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2605 <b>Ultra Watch Face is fully Wear OS 3 supported</b><br><br>NEW! Completely new redesigned Ultra watch face!. A nice, clean and interactive real watch face with Premium upgrade option. <br><br>\u2605<b>The watch face, currently, doesn&#39;t support Samsung Health</b>\u2605<br><br> \u2605\u2605\u2605 Free version: \u2605\u2605\u2605 <br> \u2714 Weather<br> \u2714 Watch battery indicator<br> \u2714 Phone battery indicator<br> \u2714 24 hour format<br> \u2714 Screen time<br><br> \u2605\u2605\u2605 Premium version: \u2605\u2605\u2605<br> \u2714 24 hour format<br> \u2714 Leading zero<br> \u2714 Screen time<br> \u2714 Forecast<br> \u2714 Full ambient mode option<br> \u2714 Change a color preset on tap<br> \u2714 Tap indicator<br> \u2714  Google Fit integration<br> \u2714 Background types<br> \u2714 Vibrate on every hour<br> \u2714 Weather settings (location, providers, frequency update, units)<br> \u2714 Automatic or manual weather location<br> \u2714 External and Built-in complications<br> \u2714 No ads<br><br> \u2605 Built-in complications (Premium) \u2605<br>    \u2022 Steps<br>    \u2022 Distance<br>    \u2022 Walking<br>    \u2022 Running<br>    \u2022 Biking<br>    \u2022 Calories<br>    \u2022 Fit statistics<br>    \u2022 Water counter<br>    \u2022 Coffee counter<br>    \u2022 HeartRate detector<br>    \u2022 Steps counter from sensors in wear device (built-in steps)<br>    \u2022 App shortcuts (Timer, Alarm, Flashlight, Stopwatch, Google Map, Find My Phone, Google Keep, Google Translate)<br><br>\u2605\u2605\u2605DISCLAIMER: \u2605\u2605\u2605 <br> The watch face is standalone app but the complication for phone battery requires a connection with the companion app on Android phone devices. iPhone users can not have this data due to iOS limitation.<br>The free version doesn&#39;t have option to set complications. It shows only the current weather, phone and watch battery levels.<br><br>\u2605\u2003<b> How to select shortcuts in the position (complication) (Premium) </b> \u2605<br><br>- Long tap on the watch face<br>- System shows icon &quot;gear&quot; for the watch face settings. Tap on it<br>- Select &quot;Customize&quot; option<br>- Select &quot;Complications&quot; option<br>- Select desired position<br>- Select &quot;External Complication&quot;<br>- Find &quot;General&quot; from list and select one from the list <br>- Select &quot;App shortcut&quot; and choose desired app<br>You are ready to go.<br><br>\u2605\u2003<b>Wear OS 3 integration</b><br>  \u2022\u2003Fully standalone! (iPhone and Android compatible)<br>  \u2022\u2003External complication data for the indicators<br><br>\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b><br>!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! <br>richface.watch@gmail.com<br><br>\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained<br>https://www.richface.watch/privacy",
